Pseudo-Pascal to 8086 assembly compiler - Lorenzo Dal Col, 2006
1: program
2:     var a,b,t
3:     $title = "The first 23 Fibonacci numbers (the 24th needs more than 16 bit
s):"
4: begin
5:     writeStr($title)
6:     newline
7:     a = 0
8:     b = 1
9:     loop 23
10:         writeInt(b)
11:         write(' ')
12:         t = a + b
13:         a = b
14:         b = t
15:     endloop
16: end.
